Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.11,0:00:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铃声）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:08.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马。喂，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.68,0:00:11.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）嗯～一飞冲天…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.57,0:00:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）真是的～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.39,0:00:15.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好痛 好痛～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.83,0:00:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你干嘛啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.10,0:00:20.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）课已经结束了哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.36,0:00:20.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.79,0:00:22.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 是这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.61,0:00:23.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.83,0:00:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！一飞冲天时间到！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.03,0:00:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老师说 给家里人的通知
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.33,0:00:32.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经发邮件了 让你去看一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.07,0:00:33.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么啊？通知是指什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.77,0:00:34.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.44,0:00:38.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这周六有家长参观日。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.81,0:00:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）哟 小鸟那边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.78,0:00:43.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次的家长参观日 是哪边…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.18,0:00:45.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊… 抱歉 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.75,0:00:48.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛啊 干嘛啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.07,0:00:49.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别那么顾虑啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.52,0:00:52.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我根本没放在心上！嘿嘿。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.64,0:00:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这周六啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.47,0:01:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}教学参观什么的 好麻烦啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.02,0:01:02.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）游马 教学参观到底是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.89,0:01:06.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是我们的父母来学校看我们上课啦{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.59,0:01:09.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看看有没有好好学习。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.11,0:01:11.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 你的父母已经……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.80,0:01:14.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事 只要是家人谁都行。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.33,0:01:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我有姐姐也有奶奶啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.56,0:01:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我回来了…… 咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.10,0:01:26.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奶奶 我进来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.46,0:01:30.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（春）哦 欢迎回来。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.32,0:01:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 那个……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.40,0:01:33.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样？ 这件和服。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.01,0:01:36.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这周六有同学会来着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.14,0:01:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到时候就穿这件去。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.90,0:01:39.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}周六？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.68,0:01:43.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}留梅婆婆 阿菊婆婆 还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.12,0:01:47.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}初恋对象 小吉先生过得怎么样了呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.51,0:01:49.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}姐姐。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.24,0:01:50.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）不行哦{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.70,0:01:53.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是想预支零花钱的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.16,0:01:54.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 不是啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.39,0:01:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）那是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.90,0:01:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我现在正忙着做新闻推送呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.94,0:02:02.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 铁子？ 哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.13,0:02:03.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 我忘了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.40,0:02:05.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是这周六对吧？ 同学会。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.85,0:02:08.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯 当然会去啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.54,0:02:10.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和大家见面我可是很期待的。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.40,0:02:14.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？ 游马……

Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.70,0:02:43.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}早～啊 小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.10,0:02:43.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}早上好。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.89,0:02:44.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}早上好。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.69,0:02:46.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说 今天的家长参观日{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.75,0:02:47.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁会来啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.54,0:02:48.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）我家是妈妈。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.94,0:02:52.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我家是爸爸特别起劲好像两个都会来。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.65,0:02:54.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀 我家也是哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.51,0:02:55.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎～
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.17,0:02:58.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天还有体育课吧是跳箱来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.54,0:02:59.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃…嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.56,0:03:02.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那九十九同学的一飞冲天{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.41,0:03:04.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又能看到了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.08,0:03:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 爸爸也想看！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.28,0:03:08.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（笑声）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.13,0:03:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了～ 迟到 迟到！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.17,0:03:13.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！好痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.69,0:03:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）真是的 你在干嘛啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.72,0:03:19.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}痛！？哎 姐姐！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.91,0:03:22.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛啊 盯着我看。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.50,0:03:23.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦～。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.46,0:03:27.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}人靠衣装马靠鞍这话说得真没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.16,0:03:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀 奶奶也很漂亮哦。是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.36,0:03:34.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我啊 心态上可还年轻着呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.23,0:03:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？游马 今天明明是周六还有课吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.76,0:03:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃 算是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.78,0:03:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你该不会是去补课什么的吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.97,0:03:44.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才不是呢！我出门了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.39,0:03:44.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.02,0:03:49.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～ 快点啦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.72,0:03:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你为什么{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.58,0:03:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}关于家长参观日的事没有说呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.27,0:03:58.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 因为 不太好吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.29,0:03:59.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}姐姐和奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.37,0:04:00.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都一直盼着今天呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.83,0:04:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是这样吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.29,0:04:06.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 而且我已经{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.04,0:04:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是小孩子了。 不用每回
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.84,0:04:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都来参加教学参观啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.58,0:04:13.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！ 还来得及！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.79,0:04:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天… 没 没 没有！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.16,0:04:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有 没有 没有！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.41,0:04:20.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.18,0:04:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没了！ 皇之钥不见了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.62,0:04:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什 什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.38,0:06:00.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你真的弄丢了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.25,0:06:00.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯～。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.90,0:06:02.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}若是如此{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.10,0:06:04.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定要找出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.29,0:06:06.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那对我来说是重要的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.48,0:06:09.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}烦死了！ 我知道啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.17,0:06:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是我从老爸那里得到的我的宝物啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.88,0:06:17.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《从父亲那里……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.42,0:06:19.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马父亲所持有的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.32,0:06:22.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}皇之钥之中，那东西就在里面。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.13,0:06:26.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此，他的父亲和我是否也有什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.28,0:06:28.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}联系呢？》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.36,0:06:29.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.37,0:06:30.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.22,0:06:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的父亲是个什么样的人？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.24,0:06:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我老爸？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.93,0:06:38.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯～是个奇怪的人啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.64,0:06:41.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}“无聊”这个词他超级讨厌的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.84,0:06:45.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总之，教会我一飞冲天的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.01,0:06:47.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是老爸啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.39,0:06:50.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊 哈啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.98,0:06:58.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（一马）怎么了，游马？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.21,0:07:00.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，爬上来，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.35,0:07:02.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行的。这种东西怎么可能爬得上去。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.88,0:07:05.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天啊，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.61,0:07:11.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的，太不公平了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.64,0:07:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又只有游马和爸爸一起出门。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.67,0:07:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说什么男人之间有话要谈他这么说的呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.89,0:07:24.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么嘛，那个。跟笨蛋一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.42,0:07:27.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～啊我要是生为男孩子就好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.63,0:07:32.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（未来）那这样别管那些自作主张的男人了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.17,0:07:36.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天只有女人去吃点好吃的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.37,0:07:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出门吃一顿吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.39,0:07:40.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的吗？妈妈。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.13,0:07:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了，不愧是。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.77,0:07:44.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最喜欢妈妈了。呵呵。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.97,0:07:48.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那我要吃意大利菜。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.16,0:07:50.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看，明里，光着脚哦，光着脚。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.08,0:07:59.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太阳要落山了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.96,0:08:02.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.12,0:08:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}学校里发生什么事了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.20,0:08:10.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.06,0:08:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是白痴吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.90,0:08:14.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就凭你这种菜鸟怎么可能当得上啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.60,0:08:15.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.72,0:08:18.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要成为决斗冠军。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.97,0:08:22.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我都说了你不可能当得上的吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:26.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝对，绝对要当上！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.90,0:08:31.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.43,0:08:34.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.29,0:08:35.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只是……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.92,0:08:37.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只是？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.15,0:08:39.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不想再去学校了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.94,0:08:41.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.19,0:08:45.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为学校太无聊了嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.56,0:08:48.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，你知道多维世界吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.59,0:08:51.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.29,0:08:54.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个世界虽然看起来只有一个{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.32,0:08:56.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}各种各样的世界是紧贴在一起的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.87,0:09:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个世界是由两个世界紧贴在一起形成的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.40,0:09:05.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一个是充满希望的世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.43,0:09:06.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 另一个是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.48,0:09:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既没有希望也没有任何东西的无聊世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.64,0:09:13.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那两个世界紧贴在一起。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.01,0:09:14.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎 是这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.85,0:09:15.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.71,0:09:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这边的希望世界充满了冒险与浪漫{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.74,0:09:22.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在也在等待着你的挑战。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.10,0:09:25.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 你现在身处这边这个无聊的世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.98,0:09:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要待在无聊的世界里{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.00,0:09:31.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你对待事物就只能往消极的方向去想。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.86,0:09:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那要怎么做就能去往不同的世界吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.40,0:09:37.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那简单得很。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.47,0:09:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你只要试着去成就点什么{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.62,0:09:42.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在心里定下一个目标就行了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.80,0:09:43.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}目标？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.82,0:09:47.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么都行。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.35,0:09:49.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}日行一善也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.12,0:09:52.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当早饭快拉冠军也行。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.23,0:09:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}早饭快拉是什么鬼。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.59,0:09:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.71,0:09:58.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，你的目标是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.30,0:10:00.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？我？我的目标？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.83,0:10:02.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的目标是 总有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.89,0:10:06.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为决斗的世界冠军。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.04,0:10:09.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这不是有个很棒的目标嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.40,0:10:11.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 一说起这个大家都会嘲笑我。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.60,0:10:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别在意那种事。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.66,0:10:14.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我在意啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.63,0:10:18.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在意周围人的眼光因为你没有真正地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.32,0:10:19.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}朝着那个目标去努力。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.79,0:10:20.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.02,0:10:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要你朝着那个目标开始真正地努力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.71,0:10:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就根本没空去搭理那些家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.24,0:10:29.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的人生就是一连串的挑战。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.10,0:10:32.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}觉得这世界很无聊这种想法，跟它说再见吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.81,0:10:36.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你一定能走向那个充满希望的世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.68,0:10:40.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，要时刻挑战。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.55,0:10:43.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那样才能让你的心永远振奋起来。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.41,0:10:45.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好，来决斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.13,0:10:46.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老爸来教你。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.95,0:10:48.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎哎？在这儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.76,0:10:50.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦，感觉不错嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.82,0:10:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后明天要往更高处去决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.06,0:10:59.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗冠军。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.78,0:11:01.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 老爸他一定{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.93,0:11:05.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相信我真的能成为决斗冠军。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.46,0:11:07.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以要是中途放弃的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.66,0:11:10.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就等于背叛了老爸。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.62,0:11:23.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～。 唔。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.99,0:11:26.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.34,0:11:28.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把等级4的哥哥哥魔像和
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.83,0:11:31.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不屈骑士进行叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.05,0:11:32.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.26,0:11:34.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.25,0:11:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.83,0:11:38.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.12,0:11:39.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等 这个卡组里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.23,0:11:41.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根本没放怪兽超量啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.34,0:11:44.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老爸。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.62,0:11:46.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.54,0:11:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老爸。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.89,0:11:49.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.24,0:11:52.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老爸的目标是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.17,0:11:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.94,0:11:58.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的目标啊，直说了吧就是去世界的尽头。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.83,0:12:01.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咳……哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.36,0:12:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有什么好笑的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.06,0:12:06.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为，世界的尽头什么的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.23,0:12:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老爸你真傻。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.58,0:12:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}地球可是圆的啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.10,0:12:10.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种东西，怎么可能存在嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.96,0:12:13.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这么一说，也是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.99,0:12:18.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老爸真是的！啊哈哈哈……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.36,0:12:21.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过现在想想，搞错了的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.15,0:12:23.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也许是我才对。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.08,0:12:25.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.77,0:12:30.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老爸曾经有一次跟我说过。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.15,0:12:33.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}世界尽头的故事。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.88,0:12:39.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈 哈 哈…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.18,0:12:52.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.73,0:12:58.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才那是…什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.68,0:13:07.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.97,0:13:09.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.04,0:13:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.54,0:13:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老公！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.93,0:13:17.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.28,0:13:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…老公！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.40,0:13:31.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…呜呜…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.42,0:13:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.96,0:13:38.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一马 不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.32,0:13:40.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不是要放弃希望。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.17,0:13:41.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望还在。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.21,0:13:43.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你活下去的希望还在。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.38,0:13:46.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定会回来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.75,0:13:49.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.78,0:13:54.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一马！一马！！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.67,0:13:58.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也许老爸那时候
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.04,0:14:01.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也许那时看到了什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.56,0:14:05.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 这里是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.59,0:14:11.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道 这里就是世界的尽头？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.32,0:14:38.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.25,0:14:39.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}事故发生后 过了一周
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.85,0:14:41.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爸爸才奇迹般地被救了出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.79,0:14:42.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.89,0:14:43.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.99,0:14:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 没事 不用担心。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.20,0:14:49.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.04,0:14:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）爸爸 太好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.56,0:14:54.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.25,0:14:57.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定是看到了什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.79,0:15:00.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看到了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.14,0:15:01.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}世界的尽头。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.41,0:15:02.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}世界的尽头？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.68,0:15:05.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爸爸说过。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.53,0:15:07.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个世界里有好几个世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.89,0:15:10.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定 那时 爸爸{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.41,0:15:14.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连接这个世界与另一个世界的我看到了某种东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.81,0:15:20.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这个世界与异世界连接起来……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.01,0:15:24.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说 那就是 皇之键的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.05,0:15:28.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错！ 那时候 我在这里……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.93,0:15:31.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.29,0:15:35.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法卡发动！ 火焰之魂！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.49,0:15:38.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.02,0:15:40.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈！ 这样就是我赢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.72,0:15:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你想当冠军什么的 不可能不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.91,0:15:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了！ 我一定要成为。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.94,0:15:48.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那你就赢给我看啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.29,0:15:49.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那样的话我就相信你。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.99,0:15:50.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是就是。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.99,0:15:54.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然小弟弟是不行的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.52,0:15:57.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为是小弟弟嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.05,0:16:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…… 我……。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.08,0:16:02.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（一马）一飞冲天！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.99,0:16:09.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爸爸。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.14,0:16:12.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.03,0:16:14.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.55,0:16:16.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天就是勇于挑战。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.24,0:16:20.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是绝不放弃的心！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.84,0:16:28.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}迈出新的一步吧，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.87,0:16:32.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那皇之键会赐予你力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.43,0:16:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}皇之键……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.50,0:16:45.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错，我绝对不会放弃。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.36,0:16:49.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧，我！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.40,0:16:50.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爸爸从那以后就……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.92,0:16:53.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明说好会一直
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.23,0:16:55.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}教我决斗的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.39,0:17:02.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）哦哦……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.26,0:17:03.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）说到底……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.79,0:17:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）好憧憬啊～
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.48,0:17:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）观月小姐身上有着成熟女性的魅力。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.68,0:17:13.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）跟小鸟完全不是一个级别的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.71,0:17:14.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.51,0:17:16.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）咯噔！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.91,0:17:19.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}知道了啦，老妈。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.50,0:17:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁美）哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.96,0:17:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}DNA的……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.50,0:17:25.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐怖之处啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.16,0:17:28.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君还没来呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.86,0:17:30.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.88,0:17:33.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结果还是回到家里来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.92,0:17:38.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过，回来这一趟值了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.12,0:17:42.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦……有了！皇之键！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.02,0:17:46.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老爸，老妈……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.36,0:17:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我出发了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.58,0:17:52.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好久不见了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.66,0:17:54.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（米）春女士，你来得正好啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.62,0:17:56.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么事啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.64,0:17:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}记得我家小鸟和游马酱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.73,0:18:01.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是同学来着。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.52,0:18:04.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊，小鸟酱经常来我们家玩呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.73,0:18:07.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那真是，一直承蒙照顾了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.26,0:18:09.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（春）米酱也来玩吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.61,0:18:14.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最近搞到了不错的玉露哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.82,0:18:15.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.52,0:18:18.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才说到哪来着。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.19,0:18:21.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好像是游马和小鸟酱……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.39,0:18:24.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了，是同学来着。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.08,0:18:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟酱经常来家里呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.61,0:18:29.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那真是承蒙照顾了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.97,0:18:31.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.75,0:18:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才说到哪来着。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.34,0:18:36.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）铁子，好久不见！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.65,0:18:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁子）好久不见！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.38,0:18:41.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马总是给铁男君添麻烦。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.58,0:18:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁子）铁男才是呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.05,0:18:45.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很忙吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.29,0:18:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}算是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.96,0:18:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自由记者的辛酸之处呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.15,0:18:50.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那学校那边是小春去的啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.85,0:18:53.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.37,0:18:55.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为今天不是有课堂参观吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.92,0:18:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男说的啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.11,0:19:01.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.28,0:19:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.46,0:19:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉，有急事！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.32,0:19:05.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明里！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.69,0:19:13.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《那家伙是在顾虑我们……》
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.41,0:19:15.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爸爸……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.59,0:19:16.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.95,0:19:21.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什……什么啊，突然一脸严肃的。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.32,0:19:23.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小心游马的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.85,0:19:28.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的决斗迟早会唤起巨大的命运。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.73,0:19:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.92,0:19:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}迟早你会明白的。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.50,0:19:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么啊，又是游马游马的！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.96,0:19:39.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明里是姐姐嘛没办法啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.33,0:19:40.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么啊，那算什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.92,0:19:43.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你可是替姐姐的那份{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.37,0:19:46.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能和我们相处更久，可游马
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.15,0:19:48.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没法像你那样待那么久啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.93,0:19:52.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总有一天我们会从你们面前消失的。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.81,0:19:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的，搞不懂了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.93,0:19:56.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总觉得我亏大了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.92,0:20:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.62,0:20:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（右京）游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.19,0:20:10.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不……那个……。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.99,0:20:14.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好了，快点回座位坐好。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.42,0:20:15.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}失礼了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.22,0:20:19.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（右京）接下来是观月和委员长。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.50,0:20:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）是！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.07,0:20:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加油，孝！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.22,0:20:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟酱，加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.10,0:20:24.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的～。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.20,0:20:27.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总而言之，我会加油的！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.15,0:20:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（哨声）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.02,0:20:35.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～ 疼疼疼！ 有了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.25,0:20:42.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结果… 还是游马家谁都没能来啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.46,0:20:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.36,0:20:51.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.38,0:20:52.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.39,0:20:52.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.99,0:20:56.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}姐姐 奶奶 你们怎么来了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.10,0:20:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你才是为什么一直瞒着我们！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.63,0:21:01.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是啊！ 你以为我们会把游马丢在一边{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.83,0:21:03.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己开心吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.78,0:21:05.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}姐姐… 奶奶…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.07,0:21:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 一飞冲天哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.80,0:21:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.29,0:21:16.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.38,0:21:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要 挑战20段！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.75,0:21:30.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？ 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.05,0:21:31.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们在看着我。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.83,0:21:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爸爸 妈妈……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.89,0:21:46.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此 感觉我也能看见了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.26,0:21:47.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～ 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.39,0:21:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.95,0:21:50.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天的游马说不定能飞起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.21,0:21:50.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.65,0:21:53.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加油！ 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.17,0:21:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《观察结果 其14。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.20,0:21:59.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…… 你似乎被大家深爱着呢》
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.40,0:22:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.78,0:22:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.77,0:22:07.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天啊 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.22,0:22:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜致正在收看节目的各位重大发表！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.41,0:22:20.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽人气投票第一弹 举办！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.78,0:22:22.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从13只怪兽当中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.64,0:22:24.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来决定第一名吧！＞

